{"id":"3a53ecf23f18712e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PositiveConseq.md","title":"PositiveConseq","display":"PositiveConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PositiveConseq","parameters":["g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PositiveConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PositiveConseq g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsP g)\n  (and\n    (@ FmP a)\n    (forall w\n      (forall r\n        (forall v\n          (forall b\n            (forall x\n              (implies\n                (and (@ PositiveModel w r v b) (and (in x w) (forall c (implies (in c g) (@ PositiveSat w r v b x c)))))\n                (@ PositiveSat w r v b x a)))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89ed69c9801fc66e\" href=\"?note=89ed69c9801fc66e\" title=\"ZFC_FmP\">FmP</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a251742daa3129e\" href=\"?note=0a251742daa3129e\" title=\"ZFC_FormsP\">FormsP</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d37356557c5b9ca\" href=\"?note=0d37356557c5b9ca\" title=\"ZFC_PositiveModel\">PositiveModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"babc32ed6715fef7\" href=\"?note=babc32ed6715fef7\" title=\"ZFC_PositiveSat\">PositiveSat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PositiveConseq g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmP","status":"resolved","id":"89ed69c9801fc66e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmP|FmP]]；[[ZFC_FormsP|FormsP]]；[[ZFC_PositiveModel|PositiveModel]]；[[ZFC_PositiveSat|PositiveSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FormsP","status":"resolved","id":"0a251742daa3129e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmP|FmP]]；[[ZFC_FormsP|FormsP]]；[[ZFC_PositiveModel|PositiveModel]]；[[ZFC_PositiveSat|PositiveSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PositiveModel","status":"resolved","id":"0d37356557c5b9ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmP|FmP]]；[[ZFC_FormsP|FormsP]]；[[ZFC_PositiveModel|PositiveModel]]；[[ZFC_PositiveSat|PositiveSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PositiveSat","status":"resolved","id":"babc32ed6715fef7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmP|FmP]]；[[ZFC_FormsP|FormsP]]；[[ZFC_PositiveModel|PositiveModel]]；[[ZFC_PositiveSat|PositiveSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b23